e_Speed_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png/36px-Creature_Speed_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png/24px-Creature_Speed_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Movement Speed</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>6 m (20 ft)</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<p>If Us was <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lobotomised_(Condition)\" title=\"Lobotomised (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lobotomised\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lobotomised_(Condition)\" title=\"Lobotomised (Condition)\">Lobotomised</a> in the prologue, it will be significantly weakened when summoned by this action.\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Claws_(Intellect_Devourer)\" title=\"Claws (Intellect Devourer)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Claws_Imp_Icon.webp/40px-Claws_Imp_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Claws_Imp_Icon.webp/60px-Claws_Imp_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Claws_Imp_Icon.webp/80px-Claws_Imp_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Claws\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Claws_Imp_Icon.webp/40px-Claws_Imp_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Claws_Imp_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Claws_(Intellect_Devourer)\" title=\"Claws (Intellect Devourer)\">Claws</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Lash out with deadly claws. </dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Devour_Intellect\" title=\"Devour Intellect\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Devour_Intellect_Icon.webp/40px-Devour_Intellect_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Devour_Intellect_Icon.webp/60px-Devour_Intellect_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Devour_Intellect_Icon.webp/80px-Devour_Intellect_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Devour Intellect\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Devour_Intellect_Icon.webp/40px-Devour_Intellect_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Devour_Intellect_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Devour_Intellect\" title=\"Devour Intellect\">Devour Intellect</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Consume a creature's mind. If its <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> is below 4, it takes damage and is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(Condition)\" title=\"Stunned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<spa